 "relevance_note": "Single-patient case report of a person with Danon disease and a LAMP2 variant: \"a 16-year-old male with Danon disease (pathogenic mutation in the LAMP2 gene)\".",
 "method_note": "Read by hand; output assembled with a short Python script, every value from my reading. Case report about tamponade under ECMO in one 16-year-old male with Danon disease; the LAMP2 variant is not described (no cDNA/protein string), so the variants row keeps variant_original_string = 'not reported'; pathogenicity 'pathogenic' from the person's own sentence. Checklist: left ventricular hypertrophy marked observed from 'non-obstructive hypertrophic cardiomyopathy' (HCM read as LV hypertrophy; hypertrophy not stated in those words); LVOT obstruction excluded from 'non-obstructive'; reduced EF/hypokinetic LV observed from 'severe biventricular dysfunction' (no EF value given). Vital status left not reported: the paper reports recovery and extubation but does not state status at last report. No age at onset or diagnosis. Many features are acute ICU/ECMO complications (shock, tamponade, AKI, oliguria, cyanosis), recorded as observed for the person. Supplementary data file not included in the Markdown. No contradictions found.",
